WildSongBench (WSB) contains 192 song-generation prompts: 94 Chinese and 98 English, used in the YuE2 benchmarks. This repository provides prompts, exact inputs and seeds, reference scores… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/m-a-p/WildSongBench.
